==French==
===Etymology===
Conflation of Latin ''[[dumque]]'', from ''[[dum]]'' "while", and ''[[tunc]]'' "then".

===Pronunciation===
*{{audio|Fr-donc.ogg|audio}}
*[[w:IPA|IPA]]: /dɔ̃k/
*[[w:SAMPA|SAMPA]]: /dO~k/

===Adverb===
'''donc'''
# [[therefore]], [[thus]].
#* Je pense, donc je suis. &mdash; Descartes

